@baseUrl = https://localhost:7002

### All products, all fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "{ products { id name description price category stockQuantity } }"}

### Field selection
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "{ products { id name price } }"}

### Existing product
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "{ productById(id: 1) { id name description price category stockQuantity } }"}

### Missing product
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "{ productById(id: 999) { id name description price category stockQuantity } }"}

### Optional category filter
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "{ products(category: \"Books\") { id name category } }"}
